cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use EUR-LexRD in your research, please cite the dataset using the
  metadata in this file.
type: dataset
title: >-
  EUR-Lex Retrieval Dataset: An Annotated Corpus of CJEU Judgments for
  Long-Form Similar Case Retrieval
version: 1.0.0

authors:
  - family-names: Koolen
    given-names: Christof
    affiliation: KU Leuven, Centre for IT & IP Law

abstract: >-
  EUR-LexRD is a legal information retrieval dataset for long-form
  similar-case retrieval over English-language judgments of the Court of
  Justice of the European Union. It contains structured judgment
  representations, 100 query judgments, pooled candidate cases, human binary
  and graded relevance judgments, citation-derived relevance judgments,
  section-aware evaluation views, a fixed supervised split, and five-fold
  cross-validation assignments.

keywords:
  - legal information retrieval
  - similar case retrieval
  - legal case retrieval
  - Court of Justice of the European Union
  - CJEU
  - EUR-Lex
  - long-document retrieval
  - section-aware retrieval
  - natural legal language processing
  - legal NLP

